#: ../../../accordions.md:66
msgid "Nested dropdowns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../accordions.md:68
msgid ""
"Only the **direct** children of an accordion join the exclusive group. A "
"dropdown nested inside another item's *body* keeps its own independent open/"
"close behaviour, so you can freely nest expandable content within an "
"accordion item."
msgstr ""

