msgstr ""

#: ../../../accordions.md:94
msgid "Browser support"
msgstr "瀏覽器支援"

#: ../../../accordions.md:96
msgid ""
"The exclusive-open behaviour relies on the native `name` attribute on "
"`<details>` elements, which is [Baseline *Newly* Available](https://web.dev/"
"baseline) (Chrome/Edge 120+, Firefox 130+ and Safari 17.2+, all shipped in "
"2024). This is a deliberate exception to the project's [*Baseline Widely "
"Available*](get_started.md) policy, permitted because it **degrades "
"gracefully**: browsers that predate the feature simply ignore the shared "
"`name` and render each item as an ordinary, independently collapsible "
"dropdown. Nothing breaks — you only lose the automatic collapsing of sibling "
"items, and no JavaScript fallback is involved."
msgstr ""

